  title="Dishwasher Air Gap: What It Is & Why LA Code Requires One"
  subtitle="That little chrome cap behind your faucet is a code-required backflow protection in California — not an optional extra. Here's what it does, why a high loop isn't a substitute here, and how to clear one that's spitting water."
